      "why": "This instrument is specifically designed to measure the compressive modulus of materials, including porous scaffolds, by applying controlled uniaxial force.",
      "accessories_to_confirm": [
        "load cell with a capacity suited to the expected forces",
        "compression platens",
        "fluid bath or environmental chamber if testing in a hydrated state"
      ]
    }
