  "summary": "You can use the Universal mechanical testing system (EQ15) to determine the compressive stiffness of your porous polymer scaffold. Please note that for porous materials, this will provide an apparent structural modulus rather than a bulk material property, and you should confirm the availability of appropriate load cells and compression platens with the contact."
}

{
  "measurement_needs": ["Non-destructive internal structural characterization of a porous specimen"],
