      "technique_id": "confocal_microscopy",
      "property_id": "internal_3d_structure",
      "technique": "Confocal laser scanning microscopy",
      "why": "Confocal microscopy can provide 3D structural information, but it is limited to a depth of approximately 100 µm and requires the sample to be transparent or fluorescently labeled.",
